!-~~~~ BldgTypeDep_tmpl ~~~


!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!- This dataset includes performance curve objects that describe the part load performance of
!- building energy code minimally compliant equipment.
!-
!- The dataset is developed by the Pacific Northwest National Laboratory (PNNL), under
!- contract with the U.S. Department of Energy (DOE).
!-
!- The dataset provides curves for the following EnergyPlus objects:
!-   * Chiller:Electric:EIR
!-
!- Sets of curves are provided for the following building energy codes minimum requirements:
!-   * ASHRAE Standard 90.1-2022 Normative Appendix J (Addendum BD to 90.1-2019)
!-
!- Last update: Sept. 2022
!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!- Beginning of performance curves for Chiller:Electric:EIR:
!
!- The name of each curve follows the structure of code requirements which is as follows:
!-
!- ASHRAE901_AppJ_CondenserType_CurveID_CompressorType_SizeRange_FullLoadEff_PartLoadEff
!-
!- Where:
!-
!-   * CondenserType:
!-      * wtr: water-cooled condenser
!-      * air: air-cooled condenser
!-   * CurveID: Curve identifier from Appendix J to 90.1
!-   * CompressorType:
!-      * cent: centrifugal
!-      * pdsp: positive displacement
!-   * SizeRange:
!-      * lt: less than
!-      * gte: greater than or equal to
!-      * gt: greater than
!-   * FullLoadEff: full load efficiency at rated conditions
!-   * PartLoadEff: part load efficiency at rated conditions
!-
!- The reference conditions for all curves are the AHRI 550/590 rating conditions for
!- requirements expressed as IPLV.IP and AHRI 551/591 rating conditions requirements
!- expressed as IPLV.SI
!-
!- AHRI 550/590 rating conditions:
!-    * Leaving chilled water temperature: 44 deg. F (6.67 deg. C)
!-    * Entering condenser temperature: 85 deg. F (29.44 deg. C) for water-cooled chillers
!-                                      95 deg. F (35.0 deg. C) for air-cooled chillers
!- AHRI 551/591 rating conditions:
!-    * Leaving chilled water temperature: 7.0 deg. C
!-    * Entering condenser temperature: 30.0 deg. C for water-cooled chillers
!-                                      35.0 deg. C for air-cooled chillers
!-
!- NOTE: each set of curves presented is applicable for both AHRI 551/591 (IPLV.SI)
!- and AHRI 550/590 (IPLV.IP). At the beginning of each set, the curve names for
!- IPLV.SI is presented. This is followed by the corresponding IPLV.IP requirements.
!-
!- The dataset includes three curves for each requirement:
!-   * A curve ending in "_cap-f-t":
!-     The curve should be used as input to the following field:
!-     "Cooling Capacity Function of Temperature Curve Name"
!-   * A curve ending in "_eir-f-t":
!-     The curve should be used as input to the following field:
!-     "Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Temperature Curve Name"
!-   * A curve ending in "_eir-f-plr":
!-     The curve should be used as input to the following field:
!-     "Electric Input to Cooling Output Ratio Function of Part Load Ratio Curve Name"

!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_A_lt528kW_2.96COP_4.01IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_A_lt150ton_10.1EER_13.68IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_B_gt528kW_2.96COP_4.1IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_B_gt150ton_10.1EER_14.0IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_C_pdsp_lt264kW_4.69COP_5.86IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_C_pdsp_lt75ton_0.75kWpton_0.6IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_D_pdsp_gt264lt528kW_4.88COP_6.28IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_D_pdsp_gt75lt150ton_0.72kWpton_0.56IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_E_pdsp_gt528lt1055kW_5.33COP_6.54IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_E_pdsp_gt150lt300ton_0.66kWpton_0.538IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_F_pdsp_gte1055lt2110kW_5.77COP_6.78IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_F_pdsp_gte300lt600ton_0.61kWpton_0.519IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_G_pdsp_gt2110kW_6.28COP_7.05IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_G_pdsp_gt600ton_0.56kWpton_0.499IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_H_cent_lt528kW_5.77COP_6.41IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_H_cent_lt150ton_0.61kWpton_0.549IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_H_cent_gt528kWlt1055kW_5.77COP_6.41IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_H_cent_gt150tonlt300ton_0.61kWpton_0.549IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_I_cent_gte1055lt2110kW_6.28COP_6.76IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_I_cent_gte300lt600ton_0.56kWpton_0.52IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_J_cent_gt1407lt2110kW_6.28COP_7.05IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_J_cent_gt400lt600ton_0.56kWpton_0.499IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_J_cent_gt2110kW_6.28COP_7.05IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_J_cent_gt600ton_0.56kWpton_0.499IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_K_lt528kW_2.84COP_4.63IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_K_lt150ton_9.7EER_15.79IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_L_gt528kW_2.84COP_4.72IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_air_L_gt150ton_9.7EER_16.11IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_M_pdsp_lt264kW_4.51COP_7.05IPLV.SI
!- (Also applicable for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_M_pdsp_lt75ton_0.78kWpton_0.499IPLV.IP)


!- Set of performance curves for ASHRAE901_AppJ_wtr_N_pdsp_gt264lt528kW_4.69COP_7.19IPLV.SI
